      "source": "YG ENTERTAINMENT / BABYMONSTER Official",
      "title": "BABYMONSTER Drop Mini Album 'WE GO UP'!",
      "excerpt": "Title track 'WE GO UP' with 'PSYCHO', 'SUPA DUPA LUV', and 'WILD'. Concept films and tour dates inside.",
