      "body": [
        "BABYMONSTER have officially kicked off their latest comeback with mini album 'WE GO UP', led by the title track of the same name alongside 'PSYCHO', 'SUPA DUPA LUV', and 'WILD'.",
        "YG ENTERTAINMENT confirms the album showcases all seven members — Ruka, Pharita, Asa, Ahyeon, Rami, Rora, and Chiquita — with a music video filmed across Seoul and Los Angeles.",
        "The release arrives ahead of the world tour, where MONSTIEZ will hear the new songs live for the first time.",
        "Pre-save links are open now on all major streaming platforms."
